  "design": [
    "One real private pool is shared by from/copyBytesFrom/allocUnsafe/concat. Slow and strict-alignment allocations own actual over-allocated ArrayBuffers.",
    "Physical alignment is measured from fixed backing storage; independent snapshots preserve observed addresses and actual contents.",
    "Original configured Node validators and coded constructors are captured before guest execution, including before replacement of internal exports.",
    "Concat preserves original two-pass reads, reentrant allocation, truncation and real zero filling.",
    "Latin1 classification reads genuine Core UTF16 code units; original Node validation rejects objects without coercion.",
    "Core source, dependency and configuration bytes are unchanged from passing Core653 qualification."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Goal remains open. Latest complete full stable1787/5015 and pinned1815/4727 use older b673 source, excluding this allocation extension and9b3 Core integration.",
    "Real ShadowRealm stack callback regression remains recorded in both full audits; realm-local original Node policy is the next fix.",
    "Two contended full API attempts each passed359/360 with distinct child-process500ms and TCP5s deadline failures. Both unchanged isolated controls pass; a subsequent quiet complete run passed360/360186.87s. Failed attempts are retained and not replaced by control sums.",
    "First focused run20/21 caught private isLatin1 binding name mismatch; corrected actual empty name and reran21/21.",
    "No speed claim:8fixed-work outputs valid,0clean rounds.",
    "Iterator broadcast-waiter-cleanup remains an unchanged30s timeout. No fixture, deadline or skip changes."
  ],
